- "Can the customer publish a ROA?" is not just a remediation step but a diagnostic — inability to do so indicates the IRR object is unattested in the same class as forged AltDB entries. Framing this honestly to the customer (without accusation) enables the correct outcome including voluntary withdrawal if warranted.

